      "full_caption": "Benidorm has been named as the host of the first UCI Cycling Gala. 🎉\n\nThe inaugural edition is scheduled for 9 December in the Spanish city. Details on the programme, format and guests have not yet been made available in the report we have seen.\n\nA first edition of a UCI-branded event in Benidorm is worth watching, and we'll share more once the full details are out.\n\nWhat would you most like to see from a UCI gala?\n\nSource: Ciudadano | Benidorm\n\n#cycling #procycling #roadcycling #UCI #UCICyclingGala #Benidorm #WorldTour #cyclingnews #cyclingcommunity #Spain",
