      ],
      "full_caption": "Stoll has unveiled the G32 Superfast, a gravel race bike built around 32-inch wheels.\n\nThe reported weight is 7.4 kg, a low figure for a bike aimed at fast gravel racing. The wheel size is the headline here, since it is well outside the usual gravel standard. No further specs, pricing or availability were included in the information we have, so we will wait for more detail.\n\nWould you try a 32-inch wheel gravel bike?\n\nSource: Brujulabike.com\n\n#gravel #gravelbike #cyclingnews #bikenews #cyclingtech #Stoll #G32Superfast #gravelracing #bikelaunch #roadcycling",
